Patched HuggingFace transformers files for nanochat d24.

The upstream NanoChatForCausalLM (transformers >= 5.2) drops three
architecture features that the d24 RL model heavily relies on:

  - resid_lambdas: per-layer learnable residual scaling
  - x0_lambdas: per-layer skip connection to initial embedding
  - ve_gate + value_embeds: ResFormer-style gated value embeddings

Without these, the converted model produces garbage output.

These patched files add config flags (use_resid_lambdas, use_x0_lambdas,
use_value_embeddings, ve_gate_channels) and the corresponding model code.

Installation:
    SITE=$(python -c "import transformers; import os; print(os.path.dirname(transformers.__file__))")
    cp configuration_nanochat.py "$SITE/models/nanochat/configuration_nanochat.py"
    cp modeling_nanochat.py "$SITE/models/nanochat/modeling_nanochat.py"

Requires: transformers >= 5.2 (the .venv-hf5 environment).
